@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Contact Role API
	Testing Koroneiki Contact Role API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Customer Role  |
	| Default Account Worker Role    |
	| Default Team Role              |
	| Optional Account Customer Role |
	| Optional Account Worker Role   |
	| Optional Team Role             |

Scenario: Create and view account customer contact role
	Koroneiki account customer contact role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Customer Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                               |

Scenario: Create and view account worker contact role
	Koroneiki account worker contact role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Worker Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                               |

