Scenario: Update contact role type attempt from account customer to team and view
	Koroneiki account customer contact role types should not be able to updated via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Customer Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                            |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                    |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Customer Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                                |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |

Scenario: Update contact role type attempt from account worker to team and view
	Koroneiki account worker contact role types should not be able to updated via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Worker Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                          |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                      |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Worker Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                                |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |

Scenario: Delete account customer contact role and view
	Koroneiki account customer contact role deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                               |
	And I delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Customer Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Customer Role"

Scenario: Delete account worker contact role and view
	Koroneiki account worker contact role deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

