	| Description | This is the default worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                               |
	And I delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Worker Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Worker Role"

Scenario: Delete team contact role and view
	Koroneiki team contact roles deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

